**Reference:** `IPRU_NexGen_Project_Spec.md` (esp. §5.6, §4.4), Phase 1 + Addendum, Phase 2, Phase 3 (tool registry, `tool_registry.py`). Phases 4–5 are skipped, Phase 6 (translate-document) is done. This prompt covers **only** `@send-mail`.

**Reminder of still-open gap:** assist-routing (`/pms-assist`, `/pst-assist`) remains unscheduled from Phase 2 — unrelated to this phase, just flagging so it isn't forgotten before wrap-up.

